# Cloudflare Pages response headers (docs/operations.md).
# Cross-origin isolation for the player's threads (SharedArrayBuffer):
# with these the page is isolated on first load (crossOriginIsolated), with
# no service worker involved. The only service worker is /stream-sw.js
# (range requests for the native player, M3-05).
/*
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin
  Cross-Origin-Embedder-Policy: require-corp
  Cross-Origin-Resource-Policy: same-origin
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: no-referrer
